  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper introduces a quantum Zeno dynamics technique for enforcing arbitrary constraints in variational quantum optimization and evaluates it on portfolio optimization instances with 4–10 assets. Numerical simulations show improved approximation ratios and higher feasibility probability compared to penalty‑based QAOA, while hardware demonstrations on the Quantinuum H1‑2 trapped‑ion processor solve a 4‑asset instance using up to ~148 two‑qubit gate depth and 2000 shots.",
